WEBVTT

00:00:00.015 --> 00:00:03.596
Easy Folk Tales. The Tortoise Who Talked Too Much.

00:00:03.596 --> 00:00:05.837
A tortoise lived in a small lake.

00:00:05.837 --> 00:00:08.808
He had two friends, a pair of wild geese.

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:12.559
The tortoise was a good friend, but he had one problem.

00:00:12.559 --> 00:00:14.420
He could never stop talking.

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:16.336
One year there was no rain.

00:00:16.336 --> 00:00:18.700
The lake became smaller every day.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.641
"We must fly to another lake," said the geese.

00:00:21.641 --> 00:00:23.782
"But what about you, our friend?

00:00:23.782 --> 00:00:25.059
You cannot fly."

00:00:25.059 --> 00:00:26.588
The tortoise thought hard.

00:00:26.588 --> 00:00:28.518
"I have a plan," he said.

00:00:28.518 --> 00:00:30.025
"Find a strong stick.

00:00:30.025 --> 00:00:32.267
Each of you hold one end in your mouth.

00:00:32.267 --> 00:00:35.767
I will bite the middle, and you can carry me through the air."

00:00:35.767 --> 00:00:38.157
"It is a good plan," said the geese.

00:00:38.157 --> 00:00:40.840
"But you must keep your mouth shut all the time.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.935
If you open it, you will fall."

00:00:42.935 --> 00:00:45.267
"That is easy," said the tortoise.

00:00:45.267 --> 00:00:49.844
So the two geese flew up with the stick, and the tortoise hung from the middle.

00:00:49.844 --> 00:00:52.049
They flew over fields and hills.

00:00:52.049 --> 00:00:53.952
Then they flew over a village.

00:00:53.952 --> 00:00:55.433
Some children looked up.

00:00:55.433 --> 00:00:57.385
"Look at that!" they shouted.

00:00:57.385 --> 00:00:59.576
"Two geese are carrying a tortoise.

00:00:59.576 --> 00:01:01.431
How clever those geese are!"

00:01:01.431 --> 00:01:03.027
The tortoise was angry.

00:01:03.027 --> 00:01:05.369
It was his idea, not theirs.

00:01:05.369 --> 00:01:07.961
"It was my plan!" he wanted to say.

00:01:07.961 --> 00:01:13.121
He opened his mouth to shout it, and he fell down, down, down to the ground.

00:01:13.121 --> 00:01:15.879
Sometimes it is wise to say nothing at all.
